{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-24000","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24000-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24000-0","text":"毁灭命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24000-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24000-1","text":"从一道光开始。\n祂们坠落，陨灭的威胁居高临下。\n祂们不得不停止自我复制，争先恐后拥抱彼此，\n试图用繁殖的权利为代价，换取生存的可能。\n祂们携手，从未如此团结\n——但命途戛然而止，\n祂们趋向真正的死亡。","speaker":""}]}
